# Context size scaling: Gemma 4 vs Qwen 3.5 MLX · GraphWalks · 200-64K tokens.
# 8 charts: prefill/decode/wall/accuracy × M4/M5 (side-by-side per hardware)
# Run on the M4 machine:  just bench-ctx-m4
# Run on the M5 machine:  just bench-ctx-m5

bench-ctx-m4 *FLAGS: bench-nuke
